
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant OCR as OCR Service
    participant Database

    User->>Frontend: Enter email and upload document
    Frontend->>Backend: Submit registration request
    Backend->>Backend: Validate request
    Backend->>OCR: Submit identity document
    OCR-->>Backend: Return extracted information
    Backend->>Backend: Validate extracted data

    alt Valid data
        Backend->>Database: Store registration
        Database-->>Backend: Return registration ID
        Backend-->>Frontend: Registration successful
        Frontend-->>User: Display confirmation
    else Invalid data
        Backend-->>Frontend: Return validation error
        Frontend-->>User: Display error message
    end
